BT /F1 10 Tf 56 546 Td (The elevated decline rate caused legitimate merchants and cardholders to experience payment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 56 532 Td (failures. The fraud-scorer decline rate increased from 2.1% to 9.8% during the incident window.) Tj ET
